msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: DRTC Korean Patch\n"
"Language: ko\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\n"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:624
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"!\r\n"
"\t\tYou don't see these much anymore after all the lawsuits against it and the government ordered recalls."
msgstr ""
"!\r\n"
"\t\t소송이 줄줄이 터지고 정부가 리콜 명령을 내린 뒤로는 거의 볼 수 없는 물건이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:627
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Stay away from it"
msgstr "가까이 가지 않는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:628
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ": Use Swole-O-Flex"
msgstr ": 스월-오-플렉스 사용"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:628
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Using this will hurt."
msgstr "이걸 쓰면 아플 거다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:629
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Pick someone to use Swole-O-Flex and probably get killed:"
msgstr "스월-오-플렉스를 쓰고 아마도 죽을 사람을 고르세요:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:641
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "BACK"
msgstr "뒤로"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:644
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "All the challenges sound awful."
msgstr "도전들이 전부 끔찍하게 들린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:645
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The gnome shrieks "
msgstr "노움이 비명을 지른다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:645
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "WHATEVER, NERDS!"
msgstr "됐어, 이 찐따들아!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:645
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " and then waddles away in a huff."
msgstr " 그러고는 씩씩대며 뒤뚱뒤뚱 사라진다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:646
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " is relieved that this is all over."
msgstr "은(는) 이게 다 끝나서 안도한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:650
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " chuckles quietly."
msgstr "은(는) 조용히 킥킥 웃는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:651
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " doesn't feel much different, just kind of smug."
msgstr "은(는) 별로 달라진 건 없지만, 왠지 좀 우쭐하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:652
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " shrugs, rolls eyes."
msgstr "은(는) 어깨를 으쓱하고 눈을 굴린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:653
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " tries not to laugh."
msgstr "은(는) 웃음을 참으려고 애쓴다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:669
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "CAN YOU SURVIVE THE SADNESS?"
msgstr "슬픔 속에서 살아남을 수 있겠느냐?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:674
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "BE CURSED BY ULTIMATE EMO SADNESS!"
msgstr "궁극의 이모 슬픔의 저주를 받아라!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:675
#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:707
#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:739
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Choosing this will make "
msgstr "이걸 고르면 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:675
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "'s maximum morale be 3 lower than normal. In exchange, "
msgstr "의 최대 사기가 평소보다 3 낮아진다. 그 대가로 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:675
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " will get:"
msgstr "이(가) 받는 것:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:676
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"+ An extra point added to maximum health!\r\n"
"\t+ One point in all skills, up to each maximum!"
msgstr ""
"+ 최대 체력 1 추가!\r\n"
"\t+ 모든 기술 1씩 상승(각 최대치까지)!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:679
#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:711
#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:743
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Accept Challenge!"
msgstr "도전 수락!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:682
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Got the WHAMMER!"
msgstr "해머를 얻었다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:683
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Got a STRONG CLEAVER!"
msgstr "튼튼한 식칼을 얻었다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:684
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Got a WOODEN CLUB!"
msgstr "나무 몽둥이를 얻었다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:685
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Got a MIGHTY CLAYMORE!"
msgstr "강력한 클레이모어를 얻었다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:686
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Got a HALBERD!"
msgstr "할버드를 얻었다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:700
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "NO MORE GUNS OR CHAINSAWS! ENJOY YOUR CHALLENGE!"
msgstr "이제 총과 전기톱은 금지다! 도전을 즐겨라!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:706
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "GUNS AND CHAINSAWS ARE TOO LOUD! I HATE THEM!"
msgstr "총이랑 전기톱은 너무 시끄러워! 정말 싫어!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:707
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" no longer capable of shooting guns or using chainsaws or similar weapons. "
"In exchange, you will get "
msgstr "은(는) 더 이상 총이나 전기톱 같은 무기를 쓸 수 없다. 그 대가로 받는 것: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:708
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"one random high quality melee weapon for each member of your group!\r\n"
"\tPossible weapons: Wooden Club, The Whammer, Sturdy Cleaver, Mighty Claymore, Halberd"
msgstr ""
"일행 전원에게 무작위 고급 근접 무기 하나씩!\r\n"
"\t가능한 무기: 나무 몽둥이, 해머, 튼튼한 식칼, 강력한 클레이모어, 할버드"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:714
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Got an UZI!"
msgstr "우지를 얻었다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:715
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Got an ASSAULT RIFLE!"
msgstr "돌격소총을 얻었다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:716
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Got a MINIGUN!"
msgstr "미니건을 얻었다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:717
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Got an AUTOMATIC SHOTGUN!"
msgstr "자동 산탄총을 얻었다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:718
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Got a RIFLED SLUG SHOTGUN!"
msgstr "강선 슬러그 산탄총을 얻었다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:732
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "MELEE WEAPONS ARE FORBIDDEN FOREVER! GOOD LUCK!"
msgstr "근접 무기는 영원히 금지다! 행운을 빈다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:738
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "WHO NEEDS MELEE WEAPONS WHEN YOU HAVE FRIENDSHIP?"
msgstr "우정이 있는데 근접 무기가 왜 필요해?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:739
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " no longer capable of melee attacks. In exchange, you will get "
msgstr "은(는) 더 이상 근접 공격을 할 수 없다. 그 대가로 받는 것: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:740
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"one random high quality firearm for each member of your group, with ammo!\r\n"
"\tPossible guns: Uzi, Assault Rifle, Automatic Shotgun, Slug Shotgun, Minigun"
msgstr ""
"일행 전원에게 무작위 고급 총기 하나씩, 탄약 포함!\r\n"
"\t가능한 총: 우지, 돌격소총, 자동 산탄총, 슬러그 산탄총, 미니건"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:747
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Challenge Mode"
msgstr "도전 모드"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:748
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"During a moment's peace, a gnome shows up and starts shrieking.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"잠시 평화로운 틈에 노움 하나가 나타나 비명을 지르기 시작한다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:749
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "I'M CNOMEY THE CHALLENGE CONDUCT GNOME!"
msgstr "나는 도전 진행 노움, 크노미다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:749
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tIt gives you the choice of an extra challenge, in exchange for a "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t노움은 추가 도전을 받는 대신 이걸 주겠다고 한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:750
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "FABULOUS REWARD!"
msgstr "끝내주는 보상!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:751
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "됐어요"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:752
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "No Melee Attacks"
msgstr "근접 공격 금지"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:753
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "No Shooting/Chainsaw"
msgstr "사격/전기톱 금지"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:754
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Max Morale Penalty"
msgstr "최대 사기 감소"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:769
#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:858
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Pirate Cutlass"
msgstr "해적 커틀러스"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:770
#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:859
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Mighty Claymore"
msgstr "강력한 클레이모어"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:771
#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:860
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Sturdy Cleaver"
msgstr "튼튼한 식칼"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:784
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " picks up the "
msgstr "이(가) 집어 든다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:784
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"!\r\n"
"\tIt fuses to "
msgstr ""
"!\r\n"
"\t무기가 손에 달라붙어 버린다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:785
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " hands, preventing the use of any other weapon!"
msgstr " 손에. 이제 다른 무기는 쓸 수 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:789
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" feels naturally familiar with this weapon somehow, and also feels just a "
"little smug."
msgstr "은(는) 왠지 이 무기가 손에 익숙하게 느껴지고, 살짝 우쭐하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:797
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Who should be given the incredibly cursed "
msgstr "이 엄청나게 저주받은 무기를 누구에게 줄까: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:798
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"WARNING: The weapon will be locked to the character, and the character will "
"be reduced to one carrying slot!"
msgstr "경고: 무기는 캐릭터에게 고정되고, 그 캐릭터의 소지 칸은 하나로 줄어든다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:804
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " reads the "
msgstr "이(가) 읽는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:804
#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:806
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Dingusnomicon!"
msgstr "딩거스노미콘!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:806
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Everyone takes turns reading the "
msgstr "모두가 돌아가며 읽는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:808
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"It's an evil, ancient book covered in eyes and mouths. It keeps doing little"
" bites and also shouts "
msgstr "눈과 입으로 뒤덮인 사악하고 오래된 책이다. 자꾸 깨물고, 이렇게 외친다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:808
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "'nerd'"
msgstr "'찐따'"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:808
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " in a thousand different forgotten languages."
msgstr " 그것도 잊혀진 천 가지 언어로."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:810
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The book imparts its FORBIDDEN KNOWLEDGE!"
msgstr "책이 금지된 지식을 전수한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:820
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Bardiche"
msgstr "바르디슈"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:824
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Halberd"
msgstr "할버드"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:843
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" finds a cache of very old weapons! While sorting through unusable junk, "
msgstr "은(는) 아주 오래된 무기 더미를 발견한다! 쓸모없는 고물을 정리하다가 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:843
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " run"
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:843
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " into a lot of problems with splinters and tiny, bitey spiders."
msgstr "가시와 작고 깨무는 거미 때문에 고생을 잔뜩 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:845
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " take some useful weapons, including a "
msgstr "은(는) 쓸 만한 무기를 챙긴다. 그중엔 이것도 있다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:851
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " found a Goblin Gift Basket!"
msgstr "은(는) 고블린 선물 바구니를 발견했다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:853
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The gift basket is mildly cursed! Now "
msgstr "선물 바구니는 살짝 저주받았다! 이제 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:853
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" feels obligated to buy a gift for the unseen and possibly nonexistent "
"goblins!"
msgstr "은(는) 보이지도 않고 존재하지도 않을지 모르는 고블린들에게 선물을 사 줘야 할 것 같은 의무감을 느낀다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:865
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Cursed Treasure"
msgstr "저주받은 보물"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:867
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" looks for supplies in a creepy cabin and uncovers a hidden basement with an"
" ancient treasure!"
msgstr "은(는) 으스스한 오두막에서 물자를 찾다가 고대의 보물이 숨겨진 지하실을 발견한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:868
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"Warning: Red choices have a penalty of morale loss and nonfatal damage! The"
msgstr "경고: 빨간 선택지는 사기 하락과 치명적이지 않은 피해를 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:868
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " flashing "
msgstr " 깜빡이는 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:868
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"choice will set the character you give the weapon to down to one locked "
"slot!"
msgstr "선택지는 무기를 받은 캐릭터의 소지 칸을 고정된 한 칸으로 줄인다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:869
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Goblin Gift Basket"
msgstr "고블린 선물 바구니"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:870
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The Dingusnomicon"
msgstr "딩거스노미콘"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:871
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Long Lost Weapons"
msgstr "오래전 잃어버린 무기들"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:878
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " attempts to prepare the room for surgery."
msgstr "이(가) 수술 준비를 하려고 방을 정리한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:880
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " loses "
msgstr "은(는) 잃는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:880
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " boring old hand and gets a "
msgstr " 지루하고 낡은 손을. 그리고 얻는다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:880
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Chainsaw Hand!"
msgstr "전기톱 손!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:880
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " This modified chainsaw is more efficient!"
msgstr " 이 개조 전기톱은 더 효율적이다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:883
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid " feels INCREDIBLY smug!"
msgstr "은(는) 엄청나게 우쭐하다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:887
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The surgery went well!"
msgstr "수술이 잘 됐다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:889
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "The surgery was very clumsy."
msgstr "수술이 아주 엉망이었다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:892
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Groovy"
msgstr "끝내준다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:896
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Who do you want to give a chainsaw hand to?"
msgstr "누구에게 전기톱 손을 달아 줄까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:901
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Instead of going through with the hand replacement surgery, "
msgstr "손 교체 수술을 하는 대신, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:901
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" loots all the medical supplies in the room. There's even a Healing Spray!"
msgstr "은(는) 방에 있는 의약품을 몽땅 챙긴다. 치료 스프레이까지 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:904
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" manages to convert the chainsaw hand into a normal wieldable chainsaw!"
msgstr "은(는) 전기톱 손을 평범하게 쓸 수 있는 전기톱으로 개조하는 데 성공한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:907
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
"The chainsaw hand was designed for arm-mounted use only, so it is left "
"behind."
msgstr "전기톱 손은 팔에 장착하는 용도로만 만들어져서 두고 간다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:912
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Hand Upgrade"
msgstr "손 업그레이드"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:914
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ""
" finds a makeshift surgery room. In one corner is a skeleton with a double barrel shotgun and prosthetic chainsaw hand, both empty. \r\n"
"\tChainsaw hand? That seems like a good idea!"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 임시 수술실을 발견한다. 구석에는 쌍열 산탄총과 의수 전기톱 손을 든 해골이 있다. 둘 다 비어 있다. \r\n"
"\t전기톱 손? 좋은 생각 같은데!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:916
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Loot supplies instead"
msgstr "대신 물자를 뒤진다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:918
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid ": Replace Hand"
msgstr ": 손 교체"

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:919
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Chainsaws are better than hands."
msgstr "전기톱이 손보다 낫다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common5.df:920
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common5.df"
msgid "Replace someone's hand with a chainsaw:"
msgstr "손을 전기톱으로 바꿀 사람:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:11
#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"'s fine tastes allow true appreciation of these burgers! VITALITY up, SPEED "
"down!"
msgstr "의 고상한 입맛은 이 버거의 진가를 제대로 알아본다! 생명력 증가, 속도 감소!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" finds a box of Big McDowell burgers. 100 years could pass, and not even "
"bugs or mold would get anywhere near those things. "
msgstr "은(는) 빅 맥다월 버거 한 상자를 발견한다. 100년이 지나도 벌레도 곰팡이도 근처에 안 올 물건이다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " digs in!"
msgstr "은(는) 먹기 시작한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " goes overboard and eats WAY too much of this 'food'."
msgstr "은(는) 너무 흥분해서 이 '음식'을 지나치게 많이 먹는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" really enjoys those burgers, but they're not great for the old internal "
"organs."
msgstr "은(는) 버거를 정말 맛있게 먹지만, 내장에는 썩 좋지 않다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " finds one remaining kid's meal toy. It's a good one!"
msgstr "은(는) 하나 남은 어린이 세트 장난감을 발견한다. 좋은 거다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "PUKEYBALL found!"
msgstr "퓨키볼 발견!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "CHILDREN'S GRENADE (safe for children) found!"
msgstr "어린이용 수류탄(어린이에게 안전) 발견!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "BLUE ROBOT found!"
msgstr "파란 로봇 발견!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "The Big McDowell"
msgstr "빅 맥다월"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" loots a McDowell's, which was the most popular restaurant in the United "
"States before civilization fell. Even after all this time, the food found "
"here is still preserved due to all the chemicals."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 맥다월을 뒤진다. 문명이 무너지기 전 미국에서 가장 인기 있던 식당이다. 이렇게 오랜 시간이 지났는데도 온갖 화학물질 덕분에 "
"음식이 아직 멀쩡하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "WARNING: Burging is not great for your health but won't kill you."
msgstr "경고: 버거는 건강에 좋지 않지만 죽지는 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Find and eat burgers, pay the burg price"
msgstr "버거를 찾아 먹고, 버거의 대가를 치른다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Search for kid's meal toys instead"
msgstr "대신 어린이 세트 장난감을 찾는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:70
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" NICE!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
" 좋아!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " is uplifted and inspired by this!"
msgstr "은(는) 이걸 보고 기운과 영감을 얻는다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:75
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"The clouds look like a gigantic amount of biceps attached to each other, "
"flexing in pumpitude."
msgstr "구름이 서로 붙은 거대한 이두근 덩어리처럼 보인다. 펌핑하며 힘을 주고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:80
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "The clouds look exactly like the country of Canada!"
msgstr "구름이 캐나다라는 나라와 똑같이 생겼다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "NICE! "
msgstr "좋아! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " is inspired by this unmistakable omen!"
msgstr "은(는) 이 틀림없는 징조에 힘을 얻는다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:85
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"The cloud looks like an enormous bazooka, ready to blow up a Maximum Cheesed"
" MegaHorde of zombies."
msgstr "구름이 거대한 바주카처럼 보인다. 맥시멈 치즈 메가호드 좀비 떼를 날려 버릴 준비가 된 듯하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "The clouds look like a car that's exploding..."
msgstr "구름이 폭발하는 차처럼 보인다..."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:92
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Thinking about it a little more, this is really kind of a downer."
msgstr "조금 더 생각해 보니, 이건 정말 좀 우울하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"The cloud looks like a big sweatband, like the sky is doing cardio, possibly"
" jazzercising."
msgstr "구름이 커다란 땀 밴드처럼 보인다. 하늘이 유산소 운동을, 어쩌면 재저사이즈를 하고 있는 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "That cloud "
msgstr "저 구름은 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "JUST SO HAPPENS"
msgstr "하필이면"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " to look like a butt. Real mature."
msgstr " 엉덩이처럼 생겼다. 참 성숙하네."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "REAL mature."
msgstr "정말 성숙하네."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"The clouds look exactly like your impending failure on the Death Road. What "
"a bummer."
msgstr "구름이 데스 로드에서 곧 닥쳐올 너희의 실패와 똑같이 생겼다. 우울하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:112
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "That cloud looks exactly like "
msgstr "저 구름은 꼭 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:112
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "'s dad!"
msgstr "의 아빠 같다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:112
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " NICE!"
msgstr " 좋아!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:114
#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:116
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "NICE!"
msgstr "좋아!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:117
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Looks like it's your lucky day!"
msgstr "오늘 운수 대통인가 보다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"The cloud looks like a cloud.\r\n"
"\tI'm disappointed that you picked this, by the way."
msgstr ""
"구름이 구름처럼 생겼다.\r\n"
"\t그나저나 이걸 고르다니 실망이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:127
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"The cloud looks an enormous swarm of bees. \r\n"
"\tIt is, in fact, an enormous swarm of bees."
msgstr ""
"구름이 거대한 벌 떼처럼 보인다. \r\n"
"\t실제로도, 거대한 벌 떼다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:129
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH!"
msgstr "으아아아아아아아아악!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:133
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"The cloud looks like it's going to rain.\r\n"
"\tAnd then it does."
msgstr ""
"구름이 곧 비가 올 것처럼 보인다.\r\n"
"\t그리고 진짜 온다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"The clouds look like an enormous swarm of zombies!\r\n"
"\tWhat a bad omen!"
msgstr ""
"구름이 거대한 좀비 떼처럼 보인다!\r\n"
"\t불길한 징조다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:141
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "The thought of this makes "
msgstr "이 생각에 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:141
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " brace "
msgstr "은(는) 앞날을 위해 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:141
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "self for the future."
msgstr " 자신을 단단히 다잡는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:142
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " recovers some health!"
msgstr "은(는) 체력을 조금 회복한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:154
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Canada"
msgstr "캐나다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:155
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "A Giant Bazooka"
msgstr "거대한 바주카"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:156
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Several Big Flexing Biceps"
msgstr "힘주는 커다란 이두근 여러 개"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:157
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "An Exploding Car"
msgstr "폭발하는 차"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:158
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "A Sweatband"
msgstr "땀 밴드"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:159
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "A Butt"
msgstr "엉덩이"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:160
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Your Impending Doom"
msgstr "곧 닥쳐올 너의 파멸"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:161
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Your Dad"
msgstr "너의 아빠"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:162
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "A Buzzing Swarm of Bees"
msgstr "윙윙대는 벌 떼"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:163
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "A Cloud"
msgstr "구름"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Rain"
msgstr "비"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:165
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "A Zombie Horde"
msgstr "좀비 떼"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:183
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Cloud Watching"
msgstr "구름 구경"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:184
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "When traveling down a peaceful yet boring stretch of road, "
msgstr "평화롭지만 지루한 길을 달리던 중, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:184
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" sees a weird cloud!\r\n"
"\tThe cloud looks just like:"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 이상한 구름을 본다!\r\n"
"\t구름이 꼭 이렇게 생겼다:"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:193
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"The computer makes strange, piercing noises and distorted chirps. What the "
"heck is going on?"
msgstr "컴퓨터가 이상하고 귀를 찢는 소리와 일그러진 삐삐 소리를 낸다. 대체 무슨 일이지?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:196
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " expertly gets the computer to work. It was the hardest thing "
msgstr "은(는) 능숙하게 컴퓨터를 살려낸다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:196
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " has ever done."
msgstr "가 지금껏 해 본 일 중 가장 어려운 일이었다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:197
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "The internet seems to be down, though. How come???"
msgstr "그런데 인터넷이 끊긴 것 같다. 왜???"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:199
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" fiddles with the ancient computer. It is a complete and utter mystery. "
msgstr "은(는) 오래된 컴퓨터를 만지작거린다. 완전히 수수께끼다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:199
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" starts to make headway into understanding very old computers and, somehow, "
"car repair."
msgstr "은(는) 아주 옛날 컴퓨터를, 그리고 어째선지 자동차 수리를 조금씩 이해하기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:200
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Then the power shuts off."
msgstr "그러다 전원이 꺼진다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:205
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" plays a game about gorillas throwing bananas at each other. It is "
"incredible. The power eventually runs out, but until then, the experience is"
" magical."
msgstr "은(는) 고릴라들이 서로 바나나를 던지는 게임을 한다. 엄청나다. 결국 전기가 떨어지지만, 그때까지는 마법 같은 경험이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" siphons the gas out of the house's generator. There's a good amount left.\r\n"
"\tThe power shuts down, along with the chance to go on the internet."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 집 발전기에서 기름을 빼낸다. 꽤 많이 남아 있다.\r\n"
"\t전원이 꺼지고, 인터넷을 할 기회도 함께 사라진다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:215
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" tinkers with the computer, fiddling with the internal wiring and at one "
"point even soldering some components."
msgstr "은(는) 컴퓨터를 손보며 내부 배선을 만지작거리고, 한때는 부품을 납땜까지 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"While tedious and time-consuming, the efforts are not in vain. The computer "
"works perfectly!"
msgstr "지루하고 시간이 오래 걸렸지만, 노력은 헛되지 않았다. 컴퓨터가 완벽하게 작동한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" even manages to get a private network running by working their magic with "
"an old router!"
msgstr "은(는) 낡은 공유기로 마법을 부려 사설 네트워크까지 돌려 놓는다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:223
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Last Computer, Last Chance for Internet"
msgstr "마지막 컴퓨터, 마지막 인터넷 기회"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:224
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "In a house with a generator attached, "
msgstr "발전기가 달린 집에서 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:224
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" stumbles onto a working computer. It's one of the older style ones, when the monitors were built like an enormous brick with glass on the front.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 작동하는 컴퓨터를 우연히 발견한다. 모니터가 앞에 유리를 붙인 거대한 벽돌 같던 시절의 구형이다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:225
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " salivates. Finally, "
msgstr "은(는) 침을 흘린다. 드디어, "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:225
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "FINALLY"
msgstr "마침내"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:225
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ", a chance to watch Youtube videos!"
msgstr ", 유튜브를 볼 기회다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:228
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ": MODEM-MAXXING"
msgstr ": 모뎀 풀가동"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:231
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Try to get on the internet"
msgstr "인터넷 접속 시도"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:232
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Play QBasic games instead"
msgstr "대신 QBasic 게임을 한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:233
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Siphon the generator"
msgstr "발전기에서 기름을 뺀다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:239
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Why the HECK are skeletons driving a car??"
msgstr "대체 왜 해골들이 차를 몰고 있는 거야??"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:240
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Looks like these nerds got trapped in the BONE ZONE!"
msgstr "이 찐따들 뼈다귀 존에 갇혀 버렸네!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Hoisted... by their own peatarts...."
msgstr "자기 꾀에... 자기가 넘어갔군...."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:242
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Looks like someone got OWNED."
msgstr "누가 제대로 당했네."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:243
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Whatever! Better them than me!"
msgstr "알 게 뭐야! 내가 아니라서 다행이지!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:244
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Looks like we're FINALLY getting an answer to the BIG QUESTIONS!"
msgstr "드디어 인생의 큰 질문에 대한 답을 얻는 것 같군!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:245
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "It's the circle of life and death... on the road of death....."
msgstr "이것이 삶과 죽음의 순환이지... 죽음의 길 위에서....."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"If only these dinguses had a sweet belt buckle like me, they wouldn't have "
"turned into skeletons!"
msgstr "이 멍청이들도 나처럼 멋진 벨트 버클이 있었으면 해골이 되진 않았을 텐데!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "They probably were jerks or something, I don't know."
msgstr "아마 재수 없는 놈들이었겠지, 몰라."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:248
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"I wonder if things would be better or worse if it was a skeleton apocalypse "
"instead."
msgstr "좀비 대신 해골 종말이었으면 더 나았을까, 더 나빴을까."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"I wonder why we don't just try to eat the bones? It would help with food "
"supplies."
msgstr "그냥 뼈를 먹어 보면 어떨까? 식량 사정에 도움이 될 텐데."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:250
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "When you think about it, skeletons really are a 'social construct'..."
msgstr "생각해 보면, 해골이란 건 사실 '사회적 구성물'이야..."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "NOW things are starting to get spicy!"
msgstr "이제야 좀 매콤해지기 시작하는군!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:262
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Someone had to say this, and that someone was ME"
msgstr "누군가는 이 말을 해야 했고, 그게 바로 나였지"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:262
#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ", says "
msgstr ", 라고 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:262
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " to no one in particular, unless "
msgstr "은(는) 허공에 대고 말한다. 물론 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:262
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " was talking to the skeletons."
msgstr "가 해골들에게 말한 거라면 얘기가 다르지만."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:264
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Everyone quietly contemplates "
msgstr "모두 조용히 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:264
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "'s philosophical insight."
msgstr "의 철학적 통찰을 곱씹는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:275
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " has mixed feelings about the speech."
msgstr "은(는) 이 연설에 대해 감정이 복잡하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:281
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" gives an inspirational and contemplative speech about how we all have "
"skeletons inside of us, and how ignoring these "
msgstr "은(는) 우리 모두의 안에는 해골이 있으며, 이 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:281
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "inner skeletons"
msgstr "내면의 해골"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:281
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " is what makes life precious."
msgstr "을(를) 외면하는 것이야말로 삶을 소중하게 만든다는, 감동적이고 사색적인 연설을 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Man, I really nailed this speech"
msgstr "와, 연설 진짜 잘했다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " to an audience of absolutely no one."
msgstr "은(는) 아무도 없는 청중에게 말한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:285
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "This is uplifting and confusing/depressing at the same time."
msgstr "감동적이면서 동시에 혼란스럽고 우울하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:293
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " retrieves parts and scrap to use on the car. "
msgstr "은(는) 차에 쓸 부품과 고철을 챙긴다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:295
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " is terrible at this, and manages to bust up "
msgstr "는 이런 데 영 소질이 없어서 망가뜨린다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:295
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " hands!"
msgstr " 손을!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:299
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "The car looks undamaged!"
msgstr "차에 흠집 하나 없어 보인다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:302
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "The car still looks all busted up."
msgstr "차는 여전히 완전 박살 난 모습이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:304
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "The car looks all beat-up, but still sturdy."
msgstr "차가 다 찌그러졌지만, 그래도 튼튼해 보인다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:312
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " takes what supplies "
msgstr "은(는) 차를 뒤진다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:312
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " can find from the car."
msgstr "이(가) 찾아낸 물자를 챙긴다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:313
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"The trunk is COMPLETELY stuffed with rolls of toilet paper! Unfortunately, "
"it's all rotten and full of bugs. What a letdown."
msgstr "트렁크에 두루마리 휴지가 꽉꽉 차 있다! 안타깝게도 전부 썩고 벌레투성이다. 실망이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:317
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Death Car to Right Here"
msgstr "죽음의 차, 여기서 끝"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:318
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " runs into another car, much like "
msgstr "은(는) 다른 차와 마주친다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:318
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " car. It's rotting, nearly totaled, and it is full of "
msgstr " 차와 꼭 닮았다. 썩어 가고 거의 폐차 수준이며, 안에는 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:318
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "SKELETONS"
msgstr "해골"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:318
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" and probably a bunch of bugs and other gross things.\r\n"
"\tYet another sign that many attempt the Death Road to Canada, and not very many make it."
msgstr ""
"이 가득하고, 아마 벌레와 역겨운 것들도 잔뜩 있을 거다.\r\n"
"\t캐나다로 가는 데스 로드에 도전하는 사람은 많지만, 끝까지 가는 사람은 별로 없다는 또 하나의 증거다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:320
#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:321
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ": Be philosophical"
msgstr ": 철학적으로 군다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:322
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ": Dismantle car for parts"
msgstr ": 차를 분해해 부품을 얻는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:323
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Search car for loot"
msgstr "차를 뒤져 물자를 찾는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:324
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Leave car alone"
msgstr "차를 그냥 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:333
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " devours that burg! "
msgstr "은(는) 그 버그를 게걸스럽게 먹어 치운다! "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:333
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "IT WAS A CRITICAL HIT!!!"
msgstr "치명타였다!!!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:334
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "THE "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:335
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "XTRA SPICY WONKOR"
msgstr "엑스트라 스파이시 웡커"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:336
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "WONKOR MAXIMUM"
msgstr "웡커 맥시멈"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:337
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "GREASED WONKOR SLIDER"
msgstr "기름진 웡커 슬라이더"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:338
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "MIRACLE WONKOR"
msgstr "기적의 웡커"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:339
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " CONFERS ITS BLESSING"
msgstr "의 축복이 내린다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:342
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "HOT ENOUGH FOR YA? SPICE ENDORPHIN RUSH!"
msgstr "좀 맵지? 매운맛 엔도르핀 폭발!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:347
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "NOW THINGS ARE STARTING TO GET SPICY!"
msgstr "이제야 좀 매콤해지기 시작하는군!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:348
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "HEAT IMMUNITY GRANTED!"
msgstr "열 면역 획득!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:356
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Could this be a gift from the Gods of Burgs?"
msgstr "혹시 버그의 신이 내린 선물인가?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:362
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Extra Deluxe Ultima Wonkor Burger"
msgstr "엑스트라 디럭스 울티마 웡커 버거"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:363
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " takes shelter in a Wonkor Burger, which was a chain of burg"
msgstr "은(는) 웡커 버거에 몸을 피한다. 종말 전에 버그"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:363
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" restaurants before the apocalypse. Unfortunately, they served real food, so it should all be spoiled by now.\r\n"
"\tTo "
msgstr ""
" 체인점이었던 곳이다. 안타깝게도 진짜 음식을 팔던 곳이라 지금쯤 다 상했을 거다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:364
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" great surprise, there's an untouched and still hot Wonkor Burger right on a"
" table. "
msgstr " 예상과 달리, 테이블 위에 손도 안 댄 따끈한 웡커 버거가 놓여 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:366
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"It is the XTRA SPICY WONKOR, world famous as a burg of pain, but also... "
"hope?"
msgstr "엑스트라 스파이시 웡커다. 고통의 버그로 세계적으로 유명하지만, 동시에... 희망?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:367
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"It is known as the WONKOR MAXIMUM, a gigantic limited edition burg of power."
msgstr "웡커 맥시멈으로 알려진, 거대한 한정판 힘의 버그다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:368
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"It is the GREASED WONKOR SLIDER, a tricky burg that might slip out of your "
"hands."
msgstr "기름진 웡커 슬라이더다. 손에서 미끄러져 빠져나갈 수도 있는 까다로운 버그다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:369
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"It is the MIRACLE WONKOR, designed as the perfect burg for both health and "
"taste."
msgstr "기적의 웡커다. 건강과 맛 모두를 위한 완벽한 버그로 설계됐다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:371
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " Who will eat this burg?"
msgstr " 누가 이 버그를 먹을까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:373
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "*Translator's note: 'Burg' means 'burger'."
msgstr "*역주: '버그'는 '버거'라는 뜻이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:375
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ": Eat that Burg"
msgstr ": 그 버그를 먹는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:376
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Foolishly Abandon Burg"
msgstr "어리석게도 버그를 포기한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:384
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" feels nothing from the burning coals, except for a faint sense of "
"superiority."
msgstr "은(는) 불타는 숯 위에서 아무것도 느끼지 못한다. 어렴풋한 우월감만 빼고."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:385
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " feels vaguely disappointed by this, somehow."
msgstr "은(는) 왠지 모르게 살짝 실망한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:387
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " nearly instantly trips and hits the burning coals face-first."
msgstr "은(는) 거의 곧바로 발이 걸려 불타는 숯에 얼굴부터 처박는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:388
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "This experience toughens up "
msgstr "이 경험으로 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:388
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " skin! And also humiliates "
msgstr " 피부가 단단해진다! 그리고 체면을 구긴 건 "

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:389
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " has a good laugh."
msgstr "은(는) 실컷 웃는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:391
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Well, at least no one saw it."
msgstr "뭐, 적어도 아무도 못 봤다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:396
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Who gets to walk on the coals?"
msgstr "누가 숯 위를 걸을까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:401
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Trust Building Exercise"
msgstr "신뢰 쌓기 훈련"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:402
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
" finds a picnic site with tables laid out. There's a lot of food lying "
"around, a portion of which is still good."
msgstr "은(는) 테이블이 차려진 피크닉 장소를 발견한다. 음식이 잔뜩 널려 있고, 일부는 아직 먹을 만하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:403
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ""
"This was a company retreat, with coals set up for people to walk on to build"
" morale and trust with each other or some such nonsense. They could still be"
" lit up."
msgstr ""
"회사 워크숍 장소였다. 사기와 서로 간의 신뢰를 쌓는다나 뭐라나 하는 헛소리를 위해 사람들이 걸을 숯이 깔려 있다. 아직 불을 붙일 수 "
"있을 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:404
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Just leave this place"
msgstr "그냥 여길 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:406
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid ": Walk on burning coals"
msgstr ": 불타는 숯 위를 걷는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:408
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid " Who should walk on burning coals?"
msgstr " 누가 불타는 숯 위를 걸을까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common6.df:411
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common6.df"
msgid "Pick someone else"
msgstr "다른 사람 고르기"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid "HEALTH STATUS"
msgstr "건강 상태"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " is a dinkus with "
msgstr "은(는) 최대 체력 "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid ""
" max health.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"짜리 얼간이다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " currently has "
msgstr "의 현재 체력: "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid ""
" health.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
".\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:35
#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " has "
msgstr "는 "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid ""
" damage.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
" 피해를 입었다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " medical skill and could heal for "
msgstr " 의술로 체력을 "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid ""
" health. \r\n"
"\tTotal team health is "
msgstr ""
" 회복시킬 수 있다. \r\n"
"\t팀 전체 체력: "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tTotal team damage is "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t팀 전체 피해: "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " is really terrible at this! "
msgstr "은(는) 이런 데 정말 소질이 없다! "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " ends up making things worse!"
msgstr "는 상황을 더 악화시킨다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid "Still, "
msgstr "그래도 "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " starts to figure it out."
msgstr "는 요령을 깨치기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " is fortified by "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " for the day ahead!"
msgstr "의 보살핌으로 하루를 버틸 힘을 얻는다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:150
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid "Heal Up!"
msgstr "치료 시간!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:156
#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " rolls up "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:156
#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " sleeves and starts tending to "
msgstr " 소매를 걷어붙이고 돌보기 시작한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:156
#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " wounds."
msgstr " 상처를."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:161
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid ""
" lacks enough medical supplies, but manages to improvise some expert medical"
" care."
msgstr "은(는) 의약품이 부족하지만, 임기응변으로 훌륭한 치료를 해낸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:168
#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:274
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " tries to help, but lacks enough medical supplies."
msgstr "은(는) 도우려 하지만, 의약품이 부족하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:186
#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:292
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " treats all of "
msgstr "은(는) 남김없이 치료한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:186
#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:188
#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:292
#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:294
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " wounds! "
msgstr " 상처! "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:188
#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:294
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " treats some of "
msgstr "은(는) 일부 치료한다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:192
#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " runs low on medical supplies."
msgstr "은(는) 의약품이 바닥나고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:205
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid "Proceed and Prepare!"
msgstr "준비하고 전진!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid ""
" has no real medical issues to address, so fortifies everybody for future "
"trouble instead."
msgstr "은(는) 딱히 치료할 문제가 없어서, 대신 앞으로의 위험에 대비해 모두를 단련시킨다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:227
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " is fully healed by "
msgstr "은(는) 완전히 치료받았다. 치료한 사람: "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:230
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " is healed a bit by "
msgstr "은(는) 조금 치료받았다. 치료한 사람: "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " heals via Gnomish Regeneration!"
msgstr "은(는) 노움의 재생력으로 회복한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df:265
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-dailymedic.df"
msgid " lacks enough medical supplies, but manages to improvise."
msgstr "은(는) 의약품이 부족하지만, 어떻게든 임기응변으로 해낸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " finds a small amount of ammunition."
msgstr "은(는) 탄약을 조금 찾는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Target Practice"
msgstr "사격 연습"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" gets some time to practice shooting. \r\n"
"\t\tThe targets were even zombie themed!"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 사격 연습할 시간을 얻는다. \r\n"
"\t\t표적도 좀비 모양이었다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" gnaws on an old rusted gun for awhile. \r\n"
"\t\tIt gets drooly."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 녹슨 낡은 총을 한참 물어뜯는다. \r\n"
"\t\t침 범벅이 된다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Who should spend some time with shooting practice?"
msgstr "누가 사격 연습을 할까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
"Everyone decides to all blast the targets at once, in the dark gun range. No"
" thought is given as to whether or not this is a good idea. WHATEVER."
msgstr "모두가 어두운 사격장에서 한꺼번에 표적을 마구 쏘기로 한다. 이게 좋은 생각인지는 아무도 생각하지 않는다. 알 게 뭐야."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Abandoned Gun Range"
msgstr "버려진 사격장"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" finds a gun range. It's empty and mostly picked clean of supplies. However,"
" "
msgstr "은(는) 사격장을 발견한다. 텅 비었고 물자도 거의 털렸다. 하지만 "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " find"
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " some shooting targets and a working pistol."
msgstr " 사격 표적 몇 개와 작동하는 권총을 찾아낸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Search for Ammo"
msgstr "탄약 찾기"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:93
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " trains shooting"
msgstr "이(가) 사격 훈련"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Train Group Haphazardly"
msgstr "일행 전체를 대충 훈련"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Carefully Train One Person"
msgstr "한 명을 꼼꼼히 훈련"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " makes puppy eyes at the woman."
msgstr "은(는) 여자에게 강아지 눈빛을 보낸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " rolls over and acts all cute."
msgstr "은(는) 배를 뒤집고 귀여운 척한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:110
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "She gives "
msgstr "여자는 "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:110
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " a bunch of food!"
msgstr "에게 식량을 잔뜩 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:112
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" convinces the woman to give more details. She instead provides some great "
"exercise tips."
msgstr "은(는) 여자를 설득해 더 자세히 들으려 한다. 대신 그녀는 훌륭한 운동 팁을 알려 준다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:118
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " frantically "
msgstr "은(는) 여자를 향해 미친 듯이 소리를 낸다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:118
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "s at the woman."
msgstr "!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:120
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " cruelly calls the woman a MUSCLE NERD."
msgstr "은(는) 여자를 잔인하게 '근육 찐따'라고 부른다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " feels PUMPED UP about this story and benches a nearby log."
msgstr "은(는) 이 이야기에 완전 불타올라서 근처 통나무로 벤치 프레스를 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:127
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" meets another survivor who rants about seeing an oiled up bodybuilder that "
"was 'too swole to control', ripping zombies in half after bench-pressing "
"them."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 다른 생존자를 만난다. 그는 '너무 우람해서 감당이 안 되는' 기름 바른 보디빌더가 좀비를 벤치 프레스한 다음 반으로 찢어 "
"버리는 걸 봤다며 열변을 토한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:138
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " wonders what that was all about."
msgstr "은(는) 저게 다 무슨 소리였는지 궁금해한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:140
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Everyone in your group looks at each other nervously."
msgstr "일행 모두가 불안하게 서로를 쳐다본다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:149
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" picks one of the houses for barricading, then rests there for a few days. "
"It's a welcome break, though it was getting boring near the end."
msgstr "은(는) 집 하나를 골라 바리케이드를 치고 며칠 쉰다. 반가운 휴식이었지만, 막판엔 좀 지루해졌다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:153
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " barricades one of the houses and gets some much needed rest."
msgstr "은(는) 집 하나에 바리케이드를 치고 꼭 필요했던 휴식을 취한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:157
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" does a quick search of the most obvious places to stash supplies. Some "
"ammunition is found."
msgstr "은(는) 물자를 숨겨 두기 좋은 뻔한 곳들을 재빨리 뒤진다. 탄약을 조금 찾았다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:162
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
", always paranoid, is not surprised by the zombie and easily avoids it."
msgstr "은(는) 늘 편집증적이라 좀비에 놀라지 않고 가볍게 피한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Unfortunately the zombie found "
msgstr "안타깝게도 좀비가 먼저 찾아냈다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " first."
msgstr "."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:169
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" combs the town for supplies left behind, but gets ambushed by a single "
"zombie. "
msgstr "은(는) 남겨진 물자를 찾아 마을을 샅샅이 뒤지다가, 좀비 한 마리에게 기습당한다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:172
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Quiet Town"
msgstr "조용한 마을"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:173
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
"It's so quiet here. There's no signs of life or unlife. It seems like "
"everyone took what they could and evacuated this town immediately."
msgstr "여긴 너무 조용하다. 산 것도, 죽지 않은 것도 흔적이 없다. 다들 챙길 수 있는 걸 챙겨서 곧바로 마을을 떠난 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:174
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Scavenge town thoroughly"
msgstr "마을을 샅샅이 뒤진다"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:175
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Loot quickly and run"
msgstr "재빨리 털고 도망친다"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:177
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Rest for a day"
msgstr "하루 쉰다"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:180
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Rest for three days"
msgstr "사흘 쉰다"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:190
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Lost Stronghold"
msgstr "잃어버린 요새"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:192
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
"This apartment building was turned into a barricaded fortress. It has been "
"completely overrun by a horde of zombies. On the plus side, they seem fairly"
" docile for now."
msgstr ""
"이 아파트 건물은 바리케이드를 친 요새였다. 지금은 좀비 떼에게 완전히 점령당했다. 좋은 점은, 놈들이 지금은 꽤 얌전해 보인다는 거다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:195
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Attack the Fortress"
msgstr "요새를 공격한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:207
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" abandons the old car and starts walking through, searching cars for "
"supplies on the way."
msgstr "은(는) 낡은 차를 버리고 걸어서 지나가며, 가는 길에 차들을 뒤져 물자를 찾는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:212
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "The detour goes unexpectedly well!"
msgstr "우회로가 의외로 순조롭다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Taking this route was too optimistic, it lasted for days! "
msgstr "이 길은 너무 낙관적이었다. 며칠이나 걸렸다! "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "The route ended up being TOTAL GARBAGE, and the car was damaged."
msgstr "이 길은 완전 쓰레기였고, 차가 손상됐다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " decides to make a detour. "
msgstr "은(는) 우회하기로 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " barks out the window at a hidden, overgrown path! "
msgstr "은(는) 창밖으로 숨겨진, 수풀 우거진 길을 향해 짖는다! "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:258
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" bench presses a ruined car. This accomplishes little for clearing the "
"wreckage, and your car still has to be abandoned."
msgstr "은(는) 부서진 차를 벤치 프레스한다. 잔해를 치우는 데는 별 도움이 안 됐고, 결국 차는 버려야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:267
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
"With a combination of being pissed and perceptive, the car doesn't crash."
msgstr "분노와 눈썰미가 합쳐진 덕분에 차는 부딪히지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:270
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "It's going fine until the car slams into a rock."
msgstr "잘 가다가 차가 바위에 쾅 부딪힌다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:274
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " plows through the shoulder near the road. "
msgstr "은(는) 도로 옆 갓길을 뚫고 나간다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:280
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Traffic Jam"
msgstr "교통 체증"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:281
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
"A sea of cars blocks the road ahead. The pileup is so bad that there is no "
"obvious way through."
msgstr "차들이 바다처럼 앞길을 막고 있다. 연쇄 추돌이 너무 심해서 빠져나갈 길이 보이지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "With no car, it's not a problem to squeeze through on foot! "
msgstr "차가 없으니 걸어서 비집고 지나가면 그만이다! "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " checks the cars for supplies on the way."
msgstr "은(는) 가는 길에 차들을 뒤져 물자를 찾는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:286
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ": Aggressive offroading!"
msgstr ": 과격한 오프로드!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:290
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ": Bench press a car"
msgstr ": 차를 벤치 프레스"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:293
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ": Find a new route"
msgstr ": 새 길 찾기"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:295
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Abandon car and walk"
msgstr "차를 버리고 걷는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:315
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" is really annoyed that the candy has to be shared with friends, even though"
" they are imaginary. "
msgstr "은(는) 상상 속 친구들과 사탕을 나눠 먹어야 한다는 게 정말 짜증 난다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:315
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " rages and stomps on the candy. Now no one can have it!"
msgstr "는 분노하며 사탕을 짓밟는다. 이제 아무도 못 먹는다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:317
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
"Everyone learns a valuable lesson about sharing by trying to split an "
"already tiny candy bar. Maybe. Sort of."
msgstr "모두 이미 작은 초코바를 나눠 먹으면서 나눔에 대한 소중한 교훈을 얻는다. 아마도. 어느 정도는."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:322
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "It Really Is Fun Sized"
msgstr "진짜 한입 크기다"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:324
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
"The candy bar was chocolate! Dogs aren't supposed to eat chocolate!\r\n"
"\t\tWhat have you done?"
msgstr ""
"초코바는 초콜릿이었다! 개는 초콜릿을 먹으면 안 되는데!\r\n"
"\t\t무슨 짓을 한 거야?"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:328
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " eats that candy, big time. The sugary sweetness makes "
msgstr "은(는) 그 초코바를 아주 크게 베어 먹는다. 달콤함 덕분에 "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:328
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " feel a little better about "
msgstr "는 "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:328
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " current life in not-Canada."
msgstr " 캐나다 아닌 곳에서의 지금 삶이 조금은 괜찮게 느껴진다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:330
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " feels pretty smug about not having to share."
msgstr "는 나눠 먹지 않아도 돼서 꽤 우쭐하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:337
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Who should eat the tiny candy bar?"
msgstr "누가 작은 초코바를 먹을까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:342
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Lucky Candy Bar"
msgstr "행운의 초코바"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:344
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" finds a candy bar on the side of the road! It's 'fun sized'.\r\n"
"\tWho gets to eat it?"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 길가에서 초코바를 발견한다! '한입 크기'다.\r\n"
"\t누가 먹을까?"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:348
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Pick someone else"
msgstr "다른 사람 고르기"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:352
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Share with everyone"
msgstr "모두 나눠 먹는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:362
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" does a sweet parkour move involving just kind of walking through the "
"zombies' legs. Whatever!"
msgstr "은(는) 좀비 다리 사이로 그냥 걸어 지나가는 멋진 파쿠르 동작을 선보인다. 알 게 뭐야!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:366
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " does a"
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:366
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " SICK PARKOUR FLIP"
msgstr " 끝내주는 파쿠르 플립"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:366
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" off some garbage and over the fence. No big deal. It's all too trivial a "
"move for "
msgstr "(으)로 쓰레기를 딛고 울타리를 넘는다. 별일 아니다. 이런 건 너무 시시한 동작이다. 역시 "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:370
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" awkwardly tries to scale the fence but is way too out of shape to do so. "
"The zombies attack."
msgstr "은(는) 어설프게 울타리를 넘으려 하지만 몸이 너무 안 따라준다. 좀비들이 공격한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:374
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" manages to climb up the fence in time, avoiding being ripped apart for now."
" God bless parkouring."
msgstr "은(는) 제때 울타리를 타고 올라가, 일단은 갈가리 찢기는 걸 피한다. 파쿠르 만세."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:378
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " struggles to climb the fence. A zombie manages to get in a leg bite."
msgstr "은(는) 울타리를 오르느라 버둥거린다. 좀비가 다리를 한 입 문다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:385
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" understands the concept of throwing things, but really isn't that good at "
"it due to not having thumbs."
msgstr "은(는) 뭔가를 던진다는 개념은 이해하지만, 엄지가 없어서 영 서툴다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:388
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " bowls several zombies over by throwing garbage cans. "
msgstr "은(는) 쓰레기통을 던져 좀비 여러 마리를 볼링 핀처럼 쓰러뜨린다. "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:388
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid " escapes and gets a great workout at the same time."
msgstr "는 탈출하면서 동시에 운동도 제대로 한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:391
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" tries to fight the zombies off by throwing garbage cans at them, but "
"doesn't manage to throw enough to stop their attack."
msgstr "은(는) 좀비들에게 쓰레기통을 던져 막아 보려 하지만, 공격을 멈출 만큼 던지지 못한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:396
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" COMPLETELY flips out and starts flinging stuff at zombies followed by "
"stomping on them. It's both effective and very therapeutic for "
msgstr "은(는) 완전히 폭주해서 좀비에게 물건을 마구 던지고 짓밟는다. 효과도 좋고, 이 사람에겐 아주 좋은 치료가 된다: "

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:403
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "COMPLETELY FLIP OUT"
msgstr "완전히 폭주한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:408
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Fight or Flip"
msgstr "싸우거나 날뛰거나"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:410
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" makes mistakes while scouting a town, and gets cornered by a large group of zombies while unarmed. \r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 마을을 정찰하다 실수를 저질러, 무기도 없이 큰 좀비 무리에게 몰린다. \r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:411
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid ""
" is trapped in an alley. At the end of the alley is heavy garbage and a "
"large fence."
msgstr "는 골목에 갇혔다. 골목 끝에는 무거운 쓰레기와 커다란 울타리가 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:413
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Use Parkour Abilities"
msgstr "파쿠르 실력 발휘"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df:414
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-example-7types.df"
msgid "Throw Garbage"
msgstr "쓰레기를 던진다"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Run whenever you can! Fight when you're forced to. These zombies do not drop"
" zombie loot."
msgstr "가능하면 도망쳐! 어쩔 수 없을 때만 싸워. 이 좀비들은 좀비 전리품을 떨어뜨리지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Scavenge for all the ammo you can. Build up the skills of your team. You'll "
"need to become stronger!"
msgstr "탄약은 찾을 수 있는 만큼 다 챙겨. 일행의 기술을 키워. 더 강해져야 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Swinging melee weapons around is exhausting until you increase your strength"
" and fitness!"
msgstr "근력과 체력을 올리기 전까지는 근접 무기를 휘두르는 게 무척 힘들다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"When exhausted, you start to sweat. Stop swinging for awhile or you'll do "
"much less damage."
msgstr "지치면 땀을 흘리기 시작한다. 잠시 휘두르기를 멈추지 않으면 피해가 크게 줄어든다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"You can keep your car going way longer if you have a great mechanic in the "
"team."
msgstr "일행에 뛰어난 정비공이 있으면 차를 훨씬 오래 굴릴 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"If you don't like your Always Be Looting choices, try driving around for new"
" locations."
msgstr "'항상 물자를 뒤져라' 선택지가 마음에 안 들면, 차를 몰고 돌아다니며 새 장소를 찾아봐."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid "More people means more fighters! It also means more food consumption."
msgstr "사람이 많으면 싸울 사람도 많다! 대신 식량도 더 많이 먹는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Someone with maxed Medical skill needs less medical supplies for healing, or"
" sometimes none."
msgstr "의술 기술이 최대인 사람은 치료에 의약품을 덜 쓰거나, 가끔은 아예 안 쓴다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Higher Shooting skill means better firearms handling, with each shot "
"piercing more zombies!"
msgstr "사격 기술이 높을수록 총기를 잘 다루고, 한 발로 더 많은 좀비를 관통한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Strength lets you pick up and throw heavier furniture. Thrown furniture is "
"the best weapon."
msgstr "근력이 높으면 더 무거운 가구를 들어 던질 수 있다. 던진 가구는 최고의 무기다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"A combination of Strength and Fitness determines weapon swing speed and "
"energy use."
msgstr "근력과 체력의 조합이 무기 휘두르는 속도와 에너지 소모를 결정한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Make sure you create some custom characters! They can show up at random in "
"the game."
msgstr "커스텀 캐릭터를 꼭 만들어 봐! 게임 중에 무작위로 등장할 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"For the final stage of the trip, you will need a good group or great "
"weapons."
msgstr "여정의 마지막 단계에서는 좋은 일행이나 훌륭한 무기가 필요하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Fitness reduces melee weapon cooldown. You get a significant bonus to "
"stamina regen at 6 fitness!"
msgstr "체력은 근접 무기 재사용 대기시간을 줄여 준다. 체력 6이 되면 스태미나 회복에 큰 보너스!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"TIRED gives big stat penalties! Clear it by sleeping in the next camp or "
"resting before a mission."
msgstr "피곤 상태는 능력치에 큰 불이익을 준다! 다음 야영지에서 자거나 임무 전에 쉬면 풀린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"If team member morale gets too low, they will start arguing, despairing, and"
" backstabbing."
msgstr "일행의 사기가 너무 낮아지면 말다툼하고, 절망하고, 뒤통수를 치기 시작한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Throw furniture by picking it up then pressing attack. Throwing can be "
"powerful and efficient."
msgstr "가구를 들고 공격 버튼을 누르면 던질 수 있다. 던지기는 강력하고 효율적이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:46
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Characters can have personality traits that give them more options in "
"events!"
msgstr "캐릭터는 이벤트에서 선택지를 더 주는 성격 특성을 가질 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Paranoid characters can reduce the severity of bandit attacks, or reveal the"
" stats of new recruits."
msgstr "편집증 캐릭터는 약탈자 습격의 피해를 줄이거나, 새 동료의 능력치를 알아낼 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:48
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid "Oblivious characters can safely run out of morale. A couple times."
msgstr "눈치 없음 캐릭터는 사기가 바닥나도 괜찮다. 몇 번 정도는."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Charming characters get all sorts of bonuses, particularly in Trader Camps."
msgstr "매력적 캐릭터는 온갖 보너스를 받는다. 특히 상인 야영지에서."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Irritating characters always know the worst thing to say. They have a SECRET"
" ADVANTAGE."
msgstr "짜증 유발 캐릭터는 항상 최악의 말을 골라 한다. 그들에겐 비밀 이점이 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Bandit characters can rob many traders and other people. This can backfire "
"depending on who is robbed."
msgstr "약탈자 캐릭터는 많은 상인과 사람들을 털 수 있다. 누굴 터느냐에 따라 역효과가 날 수도 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Slow, heavy weapons can be powerful with high Strength and Fitness. "
"Otherwise they can be awful."
msgstr "느리고 무거운 무기는 근력과 체력이 높으면 강력하다. 아니면 끔찍할 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Some melee weapons break and some don't! Many common breakable weapons "
"compensate by being light."
msgstr "어떤 근접 무기는 부서지고 어떤 건 안 부서진다! 흔한 소모성 무기는 대신 가볍다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Zombies have to grab onto you for a short time before they can damage you. "
"Run away to break free!"
msgstr "좀비는 잠시 붙잡고 있어야 피해를 줄 수 있다. 도망쳐서 뿌리쳐!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Losing your car opens you up to nearly constant negative events and bandit "
"attacks."
msgstr "차를 잃으면 거의 끊임없이 나쁜 이벤트와 약탈자 습격에 시달린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Many traders offer you different things depending on how much food you have."
msgstr "많은 상인은 네가 가진 식량의 양에 따라 다른 걸 제안한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"If you have little or no food, some traders will pity you and give free "
"stuff!"
msgstr "식량이 거의 없거나 아예 없으면, 어떤 상인은 불쌍히 여겨 공짜로 물건을 준다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Dogs are very fast. For fun, try having a dog solo loot a city as everyone "
"rests!"
msgstr "개는 엄청 빠르다. 재미로, 모두 쉬는 동안 개 혼자 도시를 털게 해 봐!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid "Dog barking, horns, gunshots, and other noises draw zombie attention."
msgstr "개 짖는 소리, 경적, 총소리 같은 소음은 좀비의 관심을 끈다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:60
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Zombies can chase you for a long time, depending on how aggressive and "
"irritated they get."
msgstr "좀비는 얼마나 공격적이고 짜증이 났느냐에 따라 오랫동안 쫓아올 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:61
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Some places are death traps! Read the zombie forecast before exploring an "
"area."
msgstr "어떤 장소는 죽음의 함정이다! 지역을 탐색하기 전에 좀비 예보를 읽어 봐."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Fire and explosives can damage your own characters, so watch out. Fire is "
"especially dangerous."
msgstr "불과 폭발물은 아군 캐릭터에게도 피해를 주니 조심해. 불은 특히 위험하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Fire can clear out an army of zombies if you're lucky. It's very dangerous "
"to use indoors."
msgstr "운이 좋으면 불로 좀비 군대를 쓸어버릴 수 있다. 실내에서 쓰는 건 아주 위험하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Punching a zombie with no weapon barely does anything, besides making one "
"let you go for a moment."
msgstr "무기 없이 좀비를 주먹으로 치면 거의 효과가 없다. 잠깐 놓아주게 만드는 것 말고는."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"You can switch what character you are controlling in the pause menu, for "
"finer control."
msgstr "일시 정지 메뉴에서 조종할 캐릭터를 바꿔 더 세밀하게 조작할 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:66
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Characters that are close by can throw weapons to each other in the pause "
"menu."
msgstr "가까이 있는 캐릭터끼리는 일시 정지 메뉴에서 무기를 서로 던져 줄 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:67
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Try sacrificing someone you don't like by getting them eaten on purpose. "
"This will distract zombies."
msgstr "마음에 안 드는 사람을 일부러 먹히게 해서 희생시켜 봐. 좀비의 주의를 끌 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Character stats are initially hidden. Characters you recruit may be lying "
"about their abilities!"
msgstr "캐릭터 능력치는 처음엔 숨겨져 있다. 영입한 동료가 자기 능력을 속이고 있을 수도 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Many bandits can be bought off with food. Some bandits can be beaten by a "
"specific personality type."
msgstr "많은 약탈자는 식량으로 매수할 수 있다. 어떤 약탈자는 특정 성격으로 이길 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:70
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"If your characters all have full health, fighting off bandits will usually "
"not kill any of them."
msgstr "캐릭터들이 모두 체력이 가득하면, 약탈자와 싸워도 보통 아무도 죽지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"All stats go from 0 to 6. A stat of 0-1 will usually automatically fail. 5-6"
" will usually succeed."
msgstr "모든 능력치는 0에서 6까지다. 0-1이면 보통 자동 실패, 5-6이면 보통 성공한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Closing doors will hold off zombies for awhile, as they all forgot how to "
"open doors."
msgstr "문을 닫으면 한동안 좀비를 막을 수 있다. 놈들은 문 여는 법을 다 까먹었다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:73
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Zombies attack furniture that gets in the way. You can drop or throw objects"
" to make obstacles."
msgstr "좀비는 길을 막는 가구를 공격한다. 물건을 떨어뜨리거나 던져 장애물을 만들 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Some cars types are easier to repair than others, requiring a smaller "
"Mechanical skill."
msgstr "어떤 차종은 다른 차보다 수리하기 쉬워서, 기계 기술이 낮아도 된다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:75
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"A very high Mechanical skill will let you repair a car right away. Further "
"repairs become harder."
msgstr "기계 기술이 아주 높으면 차를 바로 고칠 수 있다. 수리를 거듭할수록 어려워진다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Slow-shooting firearms are very ammo efficient. Sometimes you'll want to "
"spray ammo with an automatic."
msgstr "느리게 쏘는 총은 탄약 효율이 아주 좋다. 가끔은 자동화기로 탄을 뿌리고 싶을 거다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:77
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Some melee weapons cleave, hitting multiple zombies in one swing. Some "
"cleaves are based on chance."
msgstr "어떤 근접 무기는 베어 넘기기가 있어 한 번에 여러 좀비를 맞힌다. 일부는 확률에 따라 발동한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Zombies get more aggressive and numerous at night. Zombies smell you better "
"if you're bleeding."
msgstr "밤에는 좀비가 더 공격적이고 많아진다. 피를 흘리면 좀비가 냄새를 더 잘 맡는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Zombies get hit for extra damage if they are knocked down, first. Some "
"weapons have high knockdown."
msgstr "좀비를 먼저 넘어뜨리면 추가 피해를 준다. 어떤 무기는 넘어뜨리는 힘이 강하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:80
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Some great melee weapons for high stat people: Knight's Sword. Sturdy "
"Machete. Fire Axe. Sledgehammer."
msgstr "능력치 높은 사람에게 좋은 근접 무기: 기사의 검, 튼튼한 마체테, 소방 도끼, 큰 망치."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Some great melee weapons for low Strength/Fitness: Aluminum Bat. Nightstick."
" Xtreme Hockey Stick."
msgstr "근력/체력이 낮은 사람에게 좋은 근접 무기: 알루미늄 배트, 경찰봉, 익스트림 하키 스틱."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:82
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Shotguns are still very effective for people with low Shooting skill. High "
"damage and knockdown."
msgstr "산탄총은 사격 기술이 낮아도 여전히 아주 효과적이다. 피해와 넘어뜨리기가 강하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:83
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"The pistols and the Uzi have the advantage of bullets being the most common "
"ammo type."
msgstr "권총과 우지는 총알이 가장 흔한 탄약이라는 장점이 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:84
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Automatic weapons are very hard to control if you have low Shooting skill."
msgstr "자동화기는 사격 기술이 낮으면 다루기가 아주 어렵다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:85
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Rifles have high damage and high piercing. One shot could splat an entire "
"line of zombies."
msgstr "소총은 피해와 관통력이 높다. 한 발로 좀비 한 줄을 통째로 날려 버릴 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"You can often have teammates rest in the car. Useful if someone's hurt or "
"you want a smaller group."
msgstr "동료를 차에서 쉬게 할 수 있는 경우가 많다. 다친 사람이 있거나 인원을 줄이고 싶을 때 유용하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:87
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"There's no real penalty for getting a teammate eaten by zombies. Just "
"throwing that fact out there."
msgstr "동료가 좀비에게 먹혀도 딱히 불이익은 없다. 그냥 그렇다고."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:90
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Rifles' penetration depends on your shooting. Higher tiers of rifles have a "
"higher penetration count ceiling."
msgstr "소총의 관통력은 사격 능력에 따라 달라진다. 높은 등급의 소총일수록 관통 수 상한이 높다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:91
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Automatic weapons are good for clearing a way through a horde in a pinch."
msgstr "자동화기는 급할 때 좀비 떼 사이로 길을 뚫는 데 좋다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:92
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Tougher gamemodes almost certainly require a well designed, thought-out "
"party composition."
msgstr "어려운 게임 모드는 잘 짜이고 신중하게 구성한 일행이 거의 필수다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:93
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"DRTC is in constant development! Join us on our discord and tell us what you"
" think of the new changes!"
msgstr "DRTC는 계속 개발 중이다! 디스코드에 들어와서 새 변경점에 대한 의견을 들려줘!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Craftsman is a trait that can make some trash weapons useable and powerful. "
"For example: the oar."
msgstr "장인은 쓰레기 무기를 쓸 만하고 강력하게 만들어 주는 특성이다. 예: 노."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"The basic starting car takes 4 mechanical to repair. Choose your perks and "
"traits wisely if you want to keep it!"
msgstr "기본 시작 차는 수리에 기계 4가 필요하다. 계속 타고 싶다면 특전과 특성을 잘 골라!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"When comparing all rifles, the cowboy rifle has the slowest penetration "
"scaling, gaining 1 pierce per 3 shooting stat."
msgstr "모든 소총 중 카우보이 소총은 관통 증가가 가장 느려서, 사격 3당 관통 1이 오른다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:97
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"When comparing all rifles, the M.O.A.R has the highest possible pierce "
"count, capping out at 11 targets per shot."
msgstr "모든 소총 중 M.O.A.R는 관통 수가 가장 높아서, 한 발에 최대 11명까지 맞힌다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:98
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Some good stat combos to have are: high wits with low attitude, high "
"attitude with low wits, low composure and low loyalty."
msgstr "좋은 능력치 조합: 재치 높고 태도 낮음, 태도 높고 재치 낮음, 침착함과 충성심 둘 다 낮음."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"If your party members aren't doing what you want, consider changing your "
"TACTIC in the pause menu."
msgstr "일행이 원하는 대로 안 움직이면, 일시 정지 메뉴에서 전술을 바꿔 봐."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:100
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Setting the TACTIC to RUNNIN' is often a good way to get NPCs inside of the "
"car."
msgstr "전술을 '튀어!'로 설정하면 NPC를 차에 태우기 쉬운 경우가 많다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Many breakable weapons make up for their fragility by being decent early-"
"game weapons."
msgstr "부서지는 무기는 대부분 게임 초반에 쓸 만하다는 걸로 약한 내구도를 보완한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:102
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Use whips on low-stats characters to help your other party members keep the "
"kill count up."
msgstr "능력치 낮은 캐릭터에게 채찍을 쥐여 주면 다른 일행의 처치 수를 올리는 데 도움이 된다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Zombies may swarm a location if you stay after 9PM. Make sure you leave on "
"time, or prepare for a fight!"
msgstr "밤 9시 이후까지 머물면 좀비가 몰려들 수 있다. 제때 떠나거나, 싸울 준비를 해!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Talk to Professor Sycamore in the INFO HUT. I hear she's pretty cool or "
"something."
msgstr "정보 오두막의 시카모어 교수와 이야기해 봐. 꽤 멋진 분이라던데."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Food and gas are often the most valuable resources in a run. Do your best to"
" preserve them!"
msgstr "식량과 기름은 보통 한 판에서 가장 귀한 자원이다. 최대한 아껴!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Movement speed is powerful! Look for opportunities to increase it whilst on "
"the road!"
msgstr "이동 속도는 강력하다! 길 위에서 올릴 기회를 찾아봐!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Struggling? Some good early fighting combos are: Fighter + Warrior, Megabuff"
" + Hyperfixated, Gun Collector + Calm Under Fire."
msgstr "힘들어? 초반에 좋은 전투 조합: 싸움꾼 + 전사, 근육 괴물 + 과몰입, 총기 수집가 + 포화 속 침착."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Struggling? Some good early support combos are: Car Nut + Inventive, Surgeon"
" + Civilized, Mechanic + Craftsman."
msgstr "힘들어? 초반에 좋은 지원 조합: 자동차광 + 창의적, 외과의 + 교양인, 정비공 + 장인."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Some automatic weapons can be useful even at low shooting if you just tap or"
" burst fire."
msgstr "어떤 자동화기는 사격이 낮아도 짧게 끊어 쏘거나 점사하면 쓸 만하다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:110
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid "The minigun offers immense power for immense ammo consumption. Beware!"
msgstr "미니건은 엄청난 탄약을 먹는 대신 엄청난 화력을 낸다. 조심해!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Paranoid, angry-strong, and calm-shooting characters are good options to "
"have to prevent bandits."
msgstr "편집증, 화나면 강해짐, 침착한 사격 캐릭터는 약탈자를 막는 데 좋은 선택이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:112
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"If you have enough healing sprays and your dead character isn't too far "
"gone, you can revive them!"
msgstr "치료 스프레이가 충분하고 죽은 캐릭터가 너무 오래되지 않았다면, 되살릴 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Hate a certain perk or trait? Think it's underpowered? Talk about it in the "
"discord! It may get reworked."
msgstr "싫은 특전이나 특성이 있어? 너무 약한 것 같아? 디스코드에서 얘기해 줘! 개편될 수도 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:114
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Whips have a stun effect, denoted by an 'X' on hit. This stun keeps downed "
"zombies on the floor for longer."
msgstr "채찍은 기절 효과가 있고, 맞으면 'X'가 표시된다. 기절하면 쓰러진 좀비가 더 오래 바닥에 누워 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:115
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"The legendary Giant Animal is an extremely resilient car, but guzzles gas at"
" an astronomic rate."
msgstr "전설의 거대 동물은 엄청나게 튼튼한 차지만, 기름을 천문학적으로 먹는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:116
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Weapons are tiered! Rare locations often contain better weapons, and AI "
"characters will pick them up."
msgstr "무기에는 등급이 있다! 희귀 장소에는 더 좋은 무기가 있는 경우가 많고, AI 캐릭터도 그걸 집어 든다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:117
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Rifles have the following pierce ranges: Cowboy 0-2, Hunting 1-6, Sniper "
"1-5, Slug 2-8."
msgstr "소총별 관통 범위: 카우보이 0-2, 사냥용 1-6, 저격 1-5, 슬러그 2-8."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:118
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Although Ranger promises a 30% ranged cooldown reduction (CDR), for some "
"weapons the CDR is actually larger."
msgstr "레인저는 원거리 재사용 대기시간 30% 감소를 약속하지만, 일부 무기는 실제로 더 많이 줄어든다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Damage is rolled as a random value between 1 and 5, which is then scaled by "
"the weapon's power stat."
msgstr "피해는 1에서 5 사이 무작위 값으로 정해지고, 무기의 위력 능력치에 따라 배율이 붙는다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:120
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Zombies always have 5 hitpoints. Considering damage rolls, a weapon with 2.5"
" will one-shot 80% of the time."
msgstr "좀비의 체력은 항상 5다. 피해 굴림을 생각하면, 위력 2.5 무기는 80% 확률로 한 방에 죽인다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"With each pierce, rifles lose 18% power and knockback. This is a "
"multiplicative penalty, applied for each pierce."
msgstr "관통할 때마다 소총은 위력과 넉백이 18%씩 줄어든다. 관통마다 곱연산으로 적용된다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:122
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Sufficiently powered rifles with high enough shooting can shoot through "
"shelves!"
msgstr "위력이 충분한 소총에 사격 기술이 높으면 선반도 뚫고 쏠 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:123
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Sufficiently powered rifles can shoot through objects, even car wrecks! Use "
"cover to your advantage!"
msgstr "위력이 충분한 소총은 물체, 심지어 차 잔해도 뚫고 쏠 수 있다! 엄폐물을 잘 활용해!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"There is functionally no difference in damage between the Zweihander and "
"Dragonslayer."
msgstr "츠바이핸더와 드래곤슬레이어는 사실상 피해 차이가 없다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid "Generally speaking, multi-hit only comes from heavier melee weapons."
msgstr "일반적으로 다중 타격은 무거운 근접 무기에만 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Whips have high cleave, low damage and stun. Axes have high cleave and "
"damage, but take ages to swing."
msgstr "채찍은 베어 넘기기가 높고 피해가 낮으며 기절을 건다. 도끼는 베어 넘기기와 피해가 높지만 휘두르는 데 한세월이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:127
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"There are good reasons to skip a rare location; many have much higher than "
"usual zombie counts."
msgstr "희귀 장소를 건너뛸 만한 이유도 있다. 대부분 평소보다 좀비가 훨씬 많다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Strength does not boost damage! Strength does however decrease weapon "
"cooldown and stamina cost per swing."
msgstr "근력은 피해를 올려 주지 않는다! 대신 무기 재사용 대기시간과 휘두를 때 스태미나 소모를 줄여 준다."

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:134
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"- Figure out your favorite traits and perks, then make a bunch of custom characters with them.\r\n"
"\t- If you have spare gas, you can skip many locations. Each skip makes good ones more likely!\r\n"
"\t- For endgame, you want high stats and either great melee weapons or an automatic + ammo.\r\n"
"\tWe've run out of hints! Good luck!"
msgstr ""
"- 좋아하는 특성과 특전을 찾아서, 그걸로 커스텀 캐릭터를 잔뜩 만들어 봐.\r\n"
"\t- 기름이 남으면 많은 장소를 건너뛸 수 있다. 건너뛸 때마다 좋은 장소가 나올 확률이 오른다!\r\n"
"\t- 엔드게임에는 높은 능력치와 함께 훌륭한 근접 무기나 자동화기 + 탄약이 필요하다.\r\n"
"\t힌트가 다 떨어졌다! 행운을 빈다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid "TESTING CITY OF LOST HOPE IN DEADLIER ROAD MODE!"
msgstr "더 치명적인 길 모드에서 잃어버린 희망의 도시 테스트 중!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:149
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid "ALL OR NOTHING!"
msgstr "모 아니면 도!"

#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:154
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid "New City Tester"
msgstr "새 도시 테스터"
